A combined token inside a forced span stops at the span's closer

```
{*a*/*} b*/
.
<p><strong>a*/</strong> b*/</p>
```

```
{/a /*b/} c*/
.
<p><em>a /*b</em> c*/</p>
```

```
{_x /*a {_b_} c*/ y_}
.
<p><u>x <strong><em>a <u>b</u> c</em></strong> y</u></p>
```

```
/*{*a*/*} b*/
.
<p><strong><em><strong>a*/</strong> b</em></strong></p>
```
